---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
import { SITE, withBase } from "../site.config";
---

<PageLayout title={`关于 — ${SITE.author}`} description={SITE.intro}>
  <header class="flex items-center gap-5 border-b border-border pb-8">
    <img src={withBase(SITE.avatar)} alt="Justice 的头像" class="h-24 w-24 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover mix-blend-multiply dark:mix-blend-normal dark:brightness-90" />
    <div>
      <h1 class="page-title tracking-[-0.035em]">Justice</h1>
      <div class="mt-2 flex gap-4 text-sm">
        <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">GitHub</a>
        <a href={withBase("/rss.xml")} class="text-link">RSS</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="max-w-[36rem] space-y-5 py-8 text-base leading-8 text-fg" aria-label="自述">
    <p>{SITE.intro}</p>
    <p>为什么开这个博客，我也说不出什么特别的理由。没有固定主题，想到什么能写就写什么。</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
